 }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"The FCC sheet contains an unexpected 74LVC1G34 buffer (U11) in the UART4 receive path, with a net named \\\"Troj_UART_IN\\\" and an output net that does not match the UART4_RX_FCC net used elsewhere, which is not in the specification. The other power, feedback, pull-up and passive values checked are consistent with the spec, so the verdict rests on this one finding.\"\n}",
